    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>武器（投石索彈丸），非普通</em><br />使用這種彈藥發動的遠程武器攻擊可以無視 <strong>半身掩護half cover</strong> 與 <strong>四分之三掩護three-quarters cover</strong>。<br />此外，使用這種彈藥發動的遠程武器攻擊不會因以最大射程攻擊而具有劣勢。</p><p>Ranged weapon attack rolls made with this ammunition ignore half and &amp;Reference[rule=Cover]{three-quarters cover}. In addition, attacking at long range doesn't impose disadvantage on ranged weapon attack rolls made with this ammunition.</p></div>",
